sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. AI CHAT OVERVIEW FLOW
    %% Luồng tổng quan Chat Assistant: Budget Filter, Idempotency, Moderation, Tool Loop & Structured Artifacts
    %% ==========================================

    actor Client as 📱/🌐 Khách Hàng (Client)
    participant Budget as ⏱️ AiExecutionBudgetFilter
    participant Locale as 🌐 LocaleContextFilter
    participant Ctrl as 🎮 AssistantController
    participant Rate as ⚡ RedisRateLimiter
    participant Idem as 📑 ChatIdempotencyService
    participant Guard as 🛡️ GroqModerationClient (Prompt Guard)
    participant ChatUC as ⚙️ ChatUseCase
    participant History as 📜 ChatHistoryService
    participant Groq as ☁️ GroqLlmClient (5 Keys Rotator)
    participant ToolReg as 🧰 AIToolRegistry (15 Tools)
    participant Mapper as 🎨 AssistantArtifactMapper
    participant DB as 🐘 PostgreSQL (ai_chat_requests, ai_conversations, ai_messages)

    Client->>Budget: POST /api/assistant/chat<br/>Headers: Accept-Language: vi, Idempotency-Key: "idem_123", X-Execution-Budget-Ms: 8000<br/>Body: { "conversationId": "uuid-conv", "message": "Tìm tour kayak ngày mai" }
    activate Budget

    Note over Budget: Thiết lập Execution Budget Deadline (Tối đa 8000ms)<br/>Kiểm tra giới hạn 8 requests AI song song/JVM (Quá tải -> HTTP 429)

    Budget->>Locale: Chuyển tiếp Request
    activate Locale
    Note over Locale: Trích xuất header Accept-Language -> SupportedLanguage.VI

    Locale->>Ctrl: invoke chat()
    activate Ctrl

    Note over Ctrl: Trích xuất SecurityContext (User ID) & TrustTier (VERIFIED/UNVERIFIED)

    Ctrl->>Rate: isAllowed(userId, clientIp, tier)
    activate Rate
    alt Vượt định mức Token Bucket
        Rate-->>Ctrl: false
        Ctrl-->>Client: HTTP 429 Too Many Requests (RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED)
    end
    Rate-->>Ctrl: true (Cho phép)
    deactivate Rate

    Ctrl->>Idem: begin(userId, key, conversationId, message, language)
    activate Idem
    alt Trùng Idempotency-Key hoặc Hash câu hỏi đã xử lý
        Idem-->>Ctrl: Claim(replay = true, cachedResponse)
        Ctrl-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK (Trả lại kết quả đã cache, không tốn token LLM)
    end
    Idem-->>Ctrl: Claim(replay = false)
    deactivate Idem

    Ctrl->>History: getOrCreateConversation(convId, userId, language)
    activate History
    History->>DB: Lấy/Tạo mới Conversation
    History-->>Ctrl: AiConversationEntity
    deactivate History

    Note over Ctrl: Kiểm tra ngôn ngữ hội thoại (Locale Guard):<br/>Nếu conversation.locale != request.language -> Ném AiConversationLocaleMismatchException (HTTP 400)

    Ctrl->>Guard: isSafe(truncatedMessage max 1800 ký tự)
    activate Guard
    alt Phát hiện Prompt Injection / Tấn công Jailbreak
        Guard-->>Ctrl: Safe = false (Mã độc / Vi phạm)
        Ctrl-->>Client: HTTP 400 Bad Request (ai.moderation.blocked)
    end
    Guard-->>Ctrl: Safe = true
    deactivate Guard

    Ctrl->>ChatUC: processMessage(conversationId, message, language, userId)
    activate ChatUC

    ChatUC->>History: loadRecentMessages(conversationId)
    ChatUC->>Groq: generateResponse(history, tools, language)
    activate Groq

    opt LLM yêu cầu gọi công cụ (Tool Call)
        Groq-->>ChatUC: ToolCall (name, arguments)
        ChatUC->>ToolReg: execute(toolCall, ToolExecutionContext)
        activate ToolReg
        ToolReg-->>ChatUC: ToolResult JSON
        deactivate ToolReg
        ChatUC->>Groq: generateResponse(history + tool_result, tools, language)
    end

    Groq-->>ChatUC: LlmResponse(content, toolCalls, responseStatus)
    deactivate Groq

    ChatUC->>Mapper: mapToArtifacts(toolCalls, language)
    activate Mapper
    Note over Mapper: Ánh xạ kết quả tool thành typed cards (AssistantArtifact):<br/>• BOOKING_CONFIRMATION_CARD<br/>• ITINERARY_PREVIEW<br/>• DISCOVERY_SUGGESTION<br/>• SERVICE_COMPARISON<br/>• REVIEW_HIGHLIGHT<br/>• CANONICAL_POLICY<br/>• SUPPORT_ACTION
    Mapper-->>ChatUC: List<AssistantArtifact> (cards, sources, actions)
    deactivate Mapper

    ChatUC->>DB: Lưu AiMessage (User & Assistant) và AuditLog
    ChatUC-->>Ctrl: Response(content, cards, sources, actions, requiredInputs, context)
    deactivate ChatUC

    opt Có Idempotency-Key
        Ctrl->>Idem: complete(claim, responseBody)
        Idem->>DB: Lưu ai_chat_requests (V22) với snapshot phản hồi
    end

    Ctrl-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK { status: "success", message, cards, sources, actions, generatedTextVerified: false }
    deactivate Ctrl
    deactivate Locale
    deactivate Budget
